     F2v : +2.000e-06
     F3  : +2.000e-06
     F4  : +2.000e-06
     F5  : +2.000e-06
  -> ALL margins >= 0 at r = 1 - eps, at every implemented
     depth.  THEOREM (normal escape): the (W, W-tilde)-word
     torus-positivity tower is FEASIBLE at full clock strength
     for normal-block reduced data, at ALL depths (one-line
     proof: G = I collapses every chain to a single-frequency
     Fejer form).  CONSEQUENCE: no proof of CPE can come from
     the (B, B-dagger) subalgebra alone - the obstruction, if
     CPE is true, lives in words that LEAVE the block algebra
     (other letters, rotations of W) or in the letter
     embedding itself.  Equivalently: the sharpest remaining
     counterexample target is an RP process whose chiral block
     is (proportional to) a ROTATION - B B^dag = c^2 I - with
     the state coupled at r <= 1.  The embedding question
     decides, and p30d attacks it.
